{"ID":"20230927142924-shgq3g3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927142924-shgq3g3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927142924-shgq3g3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927142941-z387bjt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927142941-21vtqjl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927142941-21vtqjl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:60,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:60\u0026#125;","title":"【三物小白散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927142941"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927142941-z387bjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927142941-z387bjt","updated":"20230927142941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桔梗三分，巴豆一分，贝母三分。"}]},{"ID":"20230927142941-21vtqjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927142941-21vtqjl","updated":"20230927142941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右三味为散，更于舀中杵之，以白饮和服，强人半钱匙，羸者减之。病在膈上必吐，在膈下必利。不利进热粥一杯，利不止进冷粥一杯。"}]}]}